{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34340","headline":"新秋月夕客有自远相寻者作吴体二首以赠 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"新秋月夕客有自远相寻者作吴体二首以赠 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惊闻远客访良夜，扶病起坐纶巾欹。\n清谈白紵思悄悄，玉绳银汉光离离。\n三吴烟雾且如此，百越琛賮来何时。\n林端片月落未落，强慰别情言後期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}